  "display_title": "Even Madness Strikes Thrice",
  "description": "After two failed marriages, Titiána began her third chapter in life with the help of the mysterious owner of a bar she frequented. \n\n*“No more marriage in my life!”*\n\nHaving declared she would never marry again after her two failed marriages, she vowed to build a successful flower shop and live as a fabulous single woman… but mysterious men keep approaching her. \n\n*“Let’s date, Nuna. No marriage.”\n\n“I’m not as nice as Yuri. Just be my girl, okay?”*\n\nWill Titiana really go and do something crazy for the third time?\n\n(Source: KakaoPage, translated)",
